comment.body:
Thanks for reporting that on PowerToys 0.88, typing % in PowerPoint coincided with MWB disconnecting five of eight times, while $ did not. The report does not specify how % was entered or the active keyboard layout, so we cannot yet distinguish a layout-dependent key sequence, a PowerPoint interaction, or an MWB issue. Could you please:
- share the active keyboard layout and the exact keys used to type %;
- say whether the same % sequence disconnects MWB when entered in Notepad;
- include your Windows edition, version, and OS build;
- if it happens again, capture a diagnostic report after the disconnect and follow the /bugreport instructions to share it.
